WEBVTT

00:15:27.169 --> 00:15:31.114
Second, we will be providing
the kind of care

00:15:31.138 --> 00:15:33.938
that we went into this profession to do --

00:15:33.962 --> 00:15:36.771
not just checking the boxes,

00:15:36.795 --> 00:15:40.150
but really taking care of those we serve.

00:15:41.404 --> 00:15:42.642
Thank you.

00:15:42.666 --> 00:15:46.888
(Applause)